quran[4]{c,v,t}:
  5,14,"(We also took a pledge) from those who say: ‘We are Christians.’ We took their pledge, but they (too) forgot a portion of what they were reminded. So, We let hostility and enmity arise between them till the Day of Resurrection. And soon Allah will inform them of what they had been doing."
  5,15,"O People of the Book! Indeed, Our Messenger has come to you, who clarifies for you much of what you have been concealing of the Book, and overlooks many things (that you have been doing). There has indeed come to you a light from Allah (i.e. Prophet Muhammad (blessings and peace be upon him) and a Manifest Book (i.e. the Holy Qur’an)."
  5,16,"Allah guides by it whosoever follows (the course of) His pleasure to the ways of peace, and He brings them out of darkness into light by His will, and He guides them to a straight path."
  5,17,"They indeed have disbelieved, who say: ‘Allah is the Messiah, son of Maryam (Mary).’ Say: ‘Who would have any power over Allah if He intended to destroy the Messiah, the son of Maryam, his mother, and all those on the earth?’ And to Allah belongs the kingdom of the heavens and the earth, and whatever is between them. He creates whatever He wills, and Allah is All-Capable of everything."
